OL,5,G1620 Nations Championship              
OL,6,     FIreland v South Africa (Kick-off  
OL,7,     F4.40pm). All the action from the  
OL,8,     Fmatch at Aviva Stadium, as both   
OL,9,     Fteams conclude their round-robin  
OL,10,     Ffixtures. These nations last faced
OL,11,     Feach other 12 months ago, when the
OL,12,     Fworld champions claimed a 24-13   
OL,13,     Fvictory in a chaotic encounter    
OL,14,     Fthat saw Ireland receive five     
OL,15,     Fcards, even playing with 12 men at
OL,16,     Fthe end of the first half, and the
OL,17,     FSpringboks also get reduced to 14 
OL,18,     Fmen in the second half. With      
OL,19,     Fanalysis from Bryan Habana and    
OL,20,     FDavid Flatman, pitchside inserts  
OL,21,     Fby Claire Thomas and Brian        
OL,22,     FO'Driscoll, and commentary from   
